ic than it currently  looks the juicy lasting tints are  definitely the ones i like more  they're really hydrating they keep my  lips looking nice  and it's really easy to reapply it feels  like you're just reapplying lip gloss  with the zero velvet tin i find that the  matte look it looks a little bit  five years ago with the matte lipstick  craze but after you  either blot it off or if you put on a  clear lip gloss over it then it looks  really good i'm not that good at makeup  and so i haven't really mastered the  gradient lip look so i'm sure  there are lots of people using this  matte one really  amazingly but on me i can't make a look  anything other than  straight up 2015. so i hope you like  this video i hope my reviews were  helpful  have you tried any of these products let  me know what you think in the comments  don't forget you can use the discount  code if you want to pick up anything  from stelvana  if you like the video click the like and  the subscribe you can also follow me on  instagram and check out my blog for more  beauty science  see you next time to nerd out more
 

